  "adaptations": [
    "New portable protocol-v10 command/ACK messages; fixed action allowlist, owner/world/full-force identity, ordered sequence and bounded request/ACK storage.",
    "Execute commands after authoritative movement in the normal server tick; reuse original inventory, USE, item, zoom and remote detonation handlers.",
    "Sample existing device bindings with fresh-edge suppression; preserve source command order, zoom FOV rate and crosshair types.",
    "Accept bounded authored USE rotations without requiring normalization; no movement or firing simulation is added.",
    "Fire validation, weapon drop/grab/taunt, creature escape, dead respawn, audio/FX and match rules remain subsequent work."
